\section{What the number means}{
For a tooth \eqn{t}, the threshold is the \eqn{q}-th percentile of the
sex-specific reference distribution of age at \emph{entering} \code{Ac}:

\deqn{L(t, q) = \exp(\mu_t + z_q \sigma_t)}

